@startuml uc-apply-plan
!include _theme.iuml

state applyPlan as "applyPlan()" {

  state " " as RequestingApply
  state " " as Presenting
  state " " as Confirming
  state " " as Executing

  [*] --> RequestingApply
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> asks to converge a selection they have
  already planned and understood
  end note

  RequestingApply --> Presenting
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> plans again and displays the result, because
  the state it observed a moment ago may have moved
  end note

  Presenting --> Confirming
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> asks for confirmation of exactly the displayed
  operations, and treats any answer other than y as a refusal
  end note

  Confirming --> Executing
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> authorizes that run only; confirmation is
  never a standing approval
  end note

  Executing --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> attempts each independent endpoint group and
  reports every outcome separately
  • a default-branch rename runs before resources
    that name branches
  • a failure does not roll back what succeeded
  end note
}

applyPlan --> CHANGES_APPLIED
note on link
everything requested was applied; exit 0
end note

applyPlan -[#A78BFA]-> CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED
note on link
declined at the prompt, exit 1 · something
blocked, exit 4 · an operation failed, exit 5
end note
@enduml
